                  "type": "intro",
                  "title": "Welcome to Word",
                  "content": "Microsoft Word is the most widely used word processor on Earth — billions of resumes, term papers, contracts, novels, and memos run through it. In this opening lesson you will tour the workspace, learn to select and navigate efficiently, master Undo/Redo, and understand the full save story (Save, Save As, AutoSave, file formats). Everything else in the course rests on this foundation.",
